              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali abakhola khuba babasaaka chiikhu ne khucha kameechi khulwe Baisiraeli ne khulwe alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Khukhwola endaalo eya luno basichiililila khukhola kumulimo kuno abuundu niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aarobora khumwisaayilao.",
